    "backstory": "Born in the shadow of the crumbling Snailer's Hut, 'Dusty' spent his early days scavenging for scraps. The 'Ashcaster' guitar he carries was his father's, a pre-Collapse blues legend, though now it's mostly used to blast raiders and serenade radioactive crows.",
